{"3896150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alchemystic", "steam_appid": 3896150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemystic</strong> is a exploration RPG game where you gather quest from your small shop, help villagers, protect yourself from monsters, gather ingredients and more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roam a shadow-drenched world</strong> – Traverse fog-slick streets, cryptic ruins, and whispering forests filled with secrets, side-quests, and memorable characters.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-form alchemy system</strong> – Combine any ingredients you discover to craft  potions, poisons, or cures that can save your life…or someone else’s.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-time combat </strong>– Face eldritch horrors in tense fights and repel raids that threaten the village.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ingredient hunt</strong> – Forage, harvest, and barter for hundreds of ingredients.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching dialogue &amp; unsettling lore</strong> – Talk to anyone who’ll listen. Every conversation nudges you deeper into a dark narrative.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play your way</strong> – Full controller support and customizable layouts let you play with whichever gamepad feels right.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a dense Lovecraftian atmosphere</strong> – Every flickering lantern could reveal salvation…or something that should never see the light.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alchemystic</strong> is a exploration RPG game where you ga